        "TileImage": "$($repository 729aa28f-5856-449a-9e41-3e4fedc5c38f).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Your destination is the coastal town of Sapienza, Italy. Your target is Torres Piombo, a hippie who has made a living selling drugs to high school students. You must also eliminate his associates: Craig &quot;Rocco&quot; McVeigh, newly hired kitchen hand at Villa Caruso, and Enrico Genovesi, mansion guard at the villa.\r\rThe three men will soon make their next sale, and we must intercept them. The lives of many teenagers are at stake. Good luck, 47.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
